    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>Complete hour-long wound treatments in ten minutes and add 2 recovery progress on a Weak treatment roll.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Passive</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>A wound you treat with a learned treatment ability.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Recovery</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>When you use a wound treatment ability with a printed time of one hour, complete it in ten minutes. On a Weak treatment roll, add 2 recovery progress.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785/design/cards/a-steady-hand-at-dawn.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/a-steady-hand-at-dawn.md</a> at <code>24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785</code>.</p></section>",
